{"parse":{"title":"Elk With Fanged Antlers","pageid":438961,"revid":2050747,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Elk With Fanged Antlers</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/c0/Constellation_Elk_With_Fanged_Antlers.png/revision/latest?cb=20260205151458\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation Elk With Fanged Antlers\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/c0/Constellation_Elk_With_Fanged_Antlers.png/revision/latest?cb=20260205151458\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/c0/Constellation_Elk_With_Fanged_Antlers.png/revision/latest?cb=20260205151458 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/c0/Constellation_Elk_With_Fanged_Antlers.png/revision/latest?cb=20260205151458 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation Elk With Fanged Antlers\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Elk_With_Fanged_Antlers.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Elk With Fanged Antlers.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Illuga\" title=\"Illuga\">Illuga</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vigilant_Sentinel\" title=\"Vigilant Sentinel\">Vigilant Sentinel</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Earthshaking_Maw\" title=\"Earthshaking Maw\">Earthshaking Maw</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">When Elemental Burst <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Shadowless Reflection</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Shadowless Reflection</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Light the lamp, dealing <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>AoE Geo DMG</b></span>, and gain Haunted Night's Oriole-Song effect for 20s. When this effect is active, Illuga gains 21 stacks of <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Nightingale's Song</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Nightingale's Song</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">The effect gained after Illuga unleashes his Elemental Burst Shadowless Reflection. It can increase the <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo DMG</b></span> inflicted by current active characters.</span></span></span>. When Normal Attacks, Charged Attacks, Plunging Attacks, Elemental Skills, and Elemental Bursts of nearby active party members deal <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo DMG</b></span> to opponents, 1 stack of Nightingale's Song is consumed to increase the DMG dealt. Increase in DMG is based on Illuga's Elemental Mastery. If DMG is inflicted by Lunar-Crystallize, DMG dealt will increase further.<br />When <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo DMG</b></span> dealt in this manner hits multiple opponents, multiple stacks of Nightingale's Song will be consumed, depending on how many opponents are hit.<br /><br />Additionally, if there are <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo Constructs</b></span> created by nearby party members on the battlefield while Illuga unleashes his Elemental Burst, or when nearby party members create <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo Constructs</b></span> while Haunted Night's Oriole-Song is active, every <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo Construct</b></span> on the battlefield will allow Illuga to gain 5 additional stacks of Nightingale's Song. Within 20s after unleashing his Elemental Burst, Illuga can gain a maximum of 15 additional stacks of Nightingale's Song this way.<br /><br />When all stacks of Nightingale's Song have been consumed, or when the state's duration ends, the Haunted Night's Oriole-Song effect will end.</span></span></span>'s Haunted Night's Oriole-Song effect is active, for every 7 stacks of <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Nightingale's Song</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Nightingale's Song</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">The effect gained after Illuga unleashes his Elemental Burst Shadowless Reflection. It can increase the <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo DMG</b></span> inflicted by current active characters.</span></span></span> consumed, Illuga will summon Aedon, dealing a single instance of <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo DMG</b></span> to 1 nearby opponent. The DMG dealt is based on 400% of Illuga's Elemental Mastery and 200% of his DEF. This DMG is considered Elemental Burst DMG.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"scale_att1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Scaling</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mastery\" title=\"Elemental Mastery\">Elemental Mastery</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/DEF\" title=\"DEF\">DEF</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Elk With Fanged Antlers</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Illuga\" title=\"Illuga\">Illuga</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_2_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 2 Constellation\">Level 2 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElk_With_Fanged_Antlers%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Elk With Fanged Antlers</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">噬枝之麋</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Shìzhī zhī Mí</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Branch‑Gnawing Elk</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">噬枝之麋</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Shìzhī zhī Mí</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">枝を咥える鹿</span><br /><small><i>Eda wo Kuwaeru Shika</i></small></td><td>Branch-Holding Deer</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">풀을</span> <span lang=\"ko\">먹는</span> <span lang=\"ko\">사슴</span><br /><small><i>Pureul Meongneun Saseum</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Alce astadevorador</td><td>Devouring Antlered Elk</td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td><span lang=\"fr\">É</span>lan aux bois carnassiers</td><td>Elk With Beastly Antlers</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Эйктюрнир</span><br /><small><i>Eyktyurnir</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Elk With Fanged Antlers</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Nai Mọc Sừng Nhánh</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Elch mit spitzem Geweih</td><td>Elk With Pointy Antlers</td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>Elk With Fanged Antlers</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>Alce com Chifres Pontudos</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>Sivri Boynuzlu Geyik</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Alce dal palco zannuto</td><td>Moose with Fanged Antlers</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElk_With_Fanged_Antlers%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/Luna_IV\" title=\"Version/Luna IV\">Version \"Luna IV\"</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Elk_With_Fanged_Antlers/Change_History?action=edit&amp;preload=Template:Change_History/Preload&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=%22Luna+IV%22&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=Elk+With+Fanged+Antlers\">Create New History</a>]</div></div></div><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Navigation\">Navigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElk_With_Fanged_Antlers%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"navbox-border navbox\" style=\"border-spacing:0;;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:2px;\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"nowraplinks mw-collapsible navbox-inner\" style=\"border-spacing:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;;\"><tbody><tr><th style=\";\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"navbox-title\"><div class=\"hidden\" style=\"float:left;width:6em;text-align:left\">&#160;</div><span class=\"\" style=\"font-size:110%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Talent\" title=\"Talent\">Talents</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Constellation\" title=\"Constellation\">Constellations</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Illuga\" title=\"Illuga\">Illuga</a></span></th></tr><tr style=\"height:2px;\"><td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0px;text-align: center;;;\" class=\"navbox-list navbox-odd\"><div style=\"padding:0em 0.25em\">\n<table width=\"100%\" style=\"table-layout: fixed; vertical-align: top;\">